images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16dqz.jpg"}, {"id": 1977368, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16dqw.jpg"}], "slug": "fish-wrangler", "storyline": "Drop a line in the water and let the fish come to you.\n\nFish Wrangler is an idle fishing RPG that has been running since 2008. Cast your line, walk away, and come back to see what bit. Your crew keeps fishing while you are gone, and the night crew works the lines while you sleep. Nothing stops when you close the window.\n\nCatch over 2,200 species across 111 towns, from the shallows around Waterport to the ice of Icelantica and much stranger water past that. Every fish you land goes in your collection, and some of them take years to find.", "summary": "The idle fishing RPG that has been running since 2008. Cast your line, walk away, and let your crew keep fishing while life happens. Catch and collect 2,200+ species across 111 towns, level up ridiculous poles, and find out what Cousin Earl keeps in the bait shed.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/fish-wrangler"}